## https://github.com/mgunyho/tere?ref=terminaltrove#keyboard-shortcuts
Enter directory under cursor      | Rt / A-l/Dn / Etr / Spc
Go to parent directory            | Lt / A-h/Up / Bksp
Go to home directory              | ~ / C-Home / C-A-h
Go to root directory              | / / A-r
Move cursor up/down               | A-k/j / Up/Dn
Move cursor up/down by one screen | PgUp/PgDn / C-u/d / A-u/d
Move cursor to the top            | Home/End / A-g/A-S-g
Erase a character from the search | Bksp
Clear the search                  | Esc
Toggle filter search              | A-f
Change case sensitivity mode      | A-c
Change gap search mode            | C-f
Change sorting mode               | A-s
Refresh current directory         | C-r
Show help screen                  | ?
Exit                              | Esc / A-q
Enter directory and exit          | A-Etr / C-Spc
Exit without changing directory   | C-c